  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JO - JACPA Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall objective is to strengthen the Jordan Association for Certified Public Accountants (JACPA) capacity to provide outsourcing services in the area of accounting and financial reporting. This will require developing a strategy based on the needed assessments of the current professional capacity and academic program. It will provide as well assistance to implement this strategy through establishing a train-the-trainer program on relevant subjects on demandcomma and contributing to uniform academic curricula in universities and colleges. The training program would include training on International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS)comma IFRS for Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs)comma International Public Sector Accounting Standards (IPSAS) and audit standardscomma in addition to other subjects related to accounting and reporting services on demand.</narrative>
  </description>
